<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ title }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --self-bg: #95ec69;
    --other-bg: #ffffff;
    --meta: #8a8a8a;
    --line: #e6e6e6;
  }
  @page { size: A4; margin: 14mm 12mm 16mm 12mm; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", "Noto Sans SC", sans-serif;
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    color: #1f1f1f;
    background: #ededed;
    -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
    print-color-adjust: exact;
  }
  .page { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 12px 10px; }
  .cover {
    background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 36px 34px; margin-bottom: 22px;
    break-after: page;
  }
  .cover h1 { font-size: 24pt; margin: 0 0 8px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .cover .sub { color: var(--meta); font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .cover table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 10.5pt; }
  .cover td { padding: 7px 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
  .cover td.k { width: 120px; color: var(--meta); }
  .notice { margin-top: 22px; padding: 14px 16px; background: #f7f7f7; border-left: 3px solid #bdbdbd;
            color: #555; font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.7; }
  .day { text-align: center; margin: 18px 0 10px; }
  .day span { background: #dadada; color: #555; font-size: 8.5pt; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 10px; }
  .msg { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin: 10px 0; break-inside: avoid; }
  .msg.self { flex-direction: row-reverse; }
  .avatar { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; flex: 0 0 34px; background: #cfcfcf; }
  .avatar img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .body { max-width: 74%; margin: 0 10px; }
  .name { font-size: 8pt; color: var(--meta); margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .msg.self .name { text-align: right; }
  .bubble {
    position: relative; display: inline-block; padding: 8px 11px; border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--other-bg); line-height: 1.55; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
  }
  .msg.self .bubble { background: var(--self-bg); }
  .bubble img { max-width: 100%; max-height: 420px; border-radius: 4px; display: block; }
  .bubble .cap { font-size: 9pt; color: var(--meta); margin-top: 5px; }
  .voice { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-width: 120px; }
  .voice .icon { font-size: 13pt; }
  .transcript { margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px dashed #cfcfcf;
                font-size: 9.5pt; color: #333; }
  .transcript .label { color: var(--meta); font-size: 8pt; margin-right: 4px; }
  .meta { margin-top: 4px; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #a5a5a5; text-align: right; }
  .system { text-align: center; margin: 12px 0; color: #8a8a8a; font-size: 8.5pt; }
  .system span { background: #dadada; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 8px; }
  .filecard { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
  .filecard .fi { font-size: 18pt; }
  .filecard .fn { font-size: 9.5pt; }
  .filecard .fs { font-size: 8pt; color: var(--meta); }
  .placeholder { color: #777; font-style: italic; }
  .footer { margin-top: 26px; text-align: center; color: #aaa; font-size: 8pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <section class="cover">
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <div class="sub">{{ subtitle }}</div>
    <table>
      <tr><td class="k">对话双方</td><td>{{ account.self_display }} &nbsp;↔&nbsp; {{ account.target_display }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="k">我的微信号</td><td>{{ account.self_wxid }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="k">对方微信号</td><td>{{ account.target_alias }}（{{ account.target_wxid }}）</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="k">记录区间</td><td>{{ stats.first_time }} — {{ stats.last_time }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="k">消息总数</td><td>{{ stats.total }} 条（文字 {{ stats.text }}，图片 {{ stats.image }}，语音 {{ stats.voice }}，视频 {{ stats.video }}）</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="k">生成时间</td><td>{{ generated_at }}</td></tr>
    </table>
    <div class="notice">
      本文件由本人在自己登录的电脑版微信中导出，内容为双方真实聊天记录的原始呈现，未做删改或拼接。
      语音消息由本地语音识别模型转写，可能存在识别误差，转写文本仅供参考，原始语音时长与顺序保持完整。
      导出与使用已取得对话双方同意，仅用于个人纪念及签证关系证明材料。
    </div>
  </section>

  {% for day in days %}
  <div class="day"><span>{{ day.date }}</span></div>
  {% for m in day.messages %}
    {% if m.sender == 'system' %}
      <div class="system"><span>{{ m.text }}</span></div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="msg {{ 'self' if m.sender == 'self' else 'other' }}">
        <div class="avatar">
          {% if m.avatar %}<img src="{{ m.avatar }}">{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="name">{{ m.name }}</div>
          <div class="bubble">
            {% if m.type == 'text' %}
              {{ m.text }}
            {% elif m.type == 'image' %}
              {% if m.image_path %}<img src="{{ m.image_path }}">{% else %}<span class="placeholder">[图片]</span>{% endif %}
              {% if m.text %}<div class="cap">{{ m.text }}</div>{% endif %}
            {% elif m.type == 'voice' %}
              <div class="voice">
                <span class="icon">🎙</span>
                <span>语音 {{ m.duration }}″</span>
              </div>
              {% if m.transcript %}
              <div class="transcript"><span class="label">转写</span>{{ m.transcript }}</div>
              {% endif %}
            {% elif m.type == 'video' %}
              <div class="voice"><span class="icon">🎬</span><span>视频 {{ m.duration }}″</span></div>
              {% if m.text %}<div class="cap">{{ m.text }}</div>{% endif %}
            {% elif m.type == 'sticker' %}
              {% if m.image_path %}<img src="{{ m.image_path }}">{% else %}<span class="placeholder">[表情]</span>{% endif %}
            {% elif m.type == 'file' %}
              <div class="filecard"><span class="fi">📄</span>
                <div><div class="fn">{{ m.text }}</div></div>
              </div>
            {% elif m.type == 'link' %}
              <div><strong>{{ m.text }}</strong>{% if m.extra %}<div class="cap">{{ m.extra }}</div>{% endif %}</div>
            {% else %}
              <span class="placeholder">[{{ m.text or '消息' }}]</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="meta">{{ m.time }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="footer">— 共 {{ stats.total }} 条消息，{{ days|length }} 天 —</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
